          <div class="panel-heading"><h2 class="panel-title"><q-icon name="show_chart" />材料涨价敏感性分析</h2><span class="panel-meta">其他费用不变</span></div>
          <div v-if="result" class="sensitivity"><article v-for="point in result.sensitivity" :key="point.change"><strong>{{ money(point.total) }}</strong><i :style="{height:`${barHeight(point.total)}%`}"></i><span>{{ point.change > 0 ? '+' : '' }}{{ point.change }}%</span></article></div>
          <div v-else class="chart-empty">完成测算后显示材料价格 -10% 至 +10% 的总成本变化</div>
