          <div class="match-selector wide"><div><span>匹配定额（可多选）</span><strong>已选择 {{ selectedQuotas.length }} 条定额</strong><div class="selected-chips"><i v-for="entry in selectedQuotas" :key="entry.code">{{ entry.code }} · {{ entry.name }}</i><p v-if="!selectedQuotas.length">请从定额库中选择一条或多条定额</p></div></div><button type="button" @click="openQuotaPicker"><q-icon name="dataset" />从定额库选择</button></div>
